# settings-focus-radio (H1): a radio focused by Tab. From the gear, Tab lands on
# the checked light-dark cell (system); options carry no :focus-visible style at
# this hash, so the shot matches settings-open and the check is behavioural
# (views.json focus / reference activeElement).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
key Tab
wait 150
shot settings-focus-radio
